				\begin{document}$${\delta }_{n}\left(k\right)=P\left({X}_{n}={x}_{n}{{{{{\rm{|}}}}}}{z}_{n}=k\right)={EL}\left(n,k\right)$$\end{document}δnk=PXn=xn∣zn=k=ELn,kand for non-leaf cells use:17\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
