				\begin{document}$${\pi }_{k}^{* }={\gamma }_{1}\left(k\right)$$\end{document}πk*=γ1k

Similarly, the transition probability matrix is estimated by calculating the prevalence of each transition across the lineage trees:20\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
